  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you today?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm alright, a bit tired.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I just started drums. My teacher wants me to learn a basic rock beat. What's the pattern?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "music.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Count one, two, three, four. Hi hat on every count, kick drum on one and three, snare on two and four.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 1.94,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "music.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, so hands and feet together.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.72,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "music.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. That's the tricky part at first, getting your limbs to do different things.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.97,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "music.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My right foot",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.49,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "music.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "keeps wanting to copy my hand.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.42,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "music.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Totally normal. Go really slowly, even just the hi hat and kick first. Add the snare once that feels easy.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "music.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How slow?",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 1.39,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "music.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Slower than feels useful. Speed comes naturally once your body knows the pattern.",
